<title>USA: U.S. stockpile says next nickel bids due on Jan 9.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile says next nickel bids due on Jan 9.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said the next bid opening for nickel is scheduled for January 9, 1997.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
